&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established technical roadmap aligned to ELT strategic priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable improvement in platform stability and uptime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthened US/India engineering collaboration model&lt;/li&gt;
