&lt;p&gt;Our New Business team is seeking a driven, hungry sales professional who combines strong sales performance with a genuine passion for social impact. You will engage C-suite leaders, build strategic pipelines, own the full sales cycle for our solutions, and consistently exceed ambitious quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone ready to own enterprise deals from start to finish and grow their career in a mission-driven market with real upside. Whether you are a top-performing Mid-Market AE ready to step into enterprise, or an early-career Enterprise AE looking for a role where your impact is visible and meaningful — we want to talk.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have sold into the corporate social responsibility, grants management, employee giving, or philanthropic technology space, this role was built for you. Strong performers from adjacent enterprise SaaS markets with a genuine passion for social impact are also encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end sales cycles with complex organizations, driving new logo acquisition and expanding strategic relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute rigorous pipeline management and accurate forecasting, leveraging sales methodologies such as MEDDIC/MEDDPICC to ensure consistent quota overachievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver compelling, tailored pitches and product demonstrations that connect our technology to long-term client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and build trusted partnerships with key stakeholders, including C-suite executives, CSR leaders, foundation executives, and grants administrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide complete and appropriate solutions for every customer in order to boost revenue growth, customer acquisition, and profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an accurate and up-to-date forecast for every open opportunity and keep clean data in Salesforce and other relevant systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to share important information and insights about client and market findings to improve marketing and sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior sales staff and contribute to a high-performance sales culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and problem-solve, providing customer feedback to influence product and program enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2–5 years of B2B SaaS experience in full-cycle sales with a demonstrated history of exceeding quota and closing complex deals — enterprise or mid-market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistent top performer with a strong track record of exceeding quota — formal recognition such as President&#39;s Club or equivalent is a plus but not required. We care more about attainment trajectory and hunger than tenure-based credentials.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience selling into corporate social responsibility, employee giving, grants management, philanthropic technology, or nonprofit SaaS is a strong advantage and strongly preferred, not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience closing deals valued at $75K–$150K+ ARR with multi-stakeholder buying processes involving 2 or more decision-makers — enterprise deal experience is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with a structured sales methodology such as MEDDIC, MEDDPICC, Challenger, or Sandler — you approach deals with discipline, qualify early, and follow a repeatable process&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated prospecting ability, pipeline generation, and new logo acquisition — you build your own pipeline and own it through close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional storytelling, presentation skills, and the ability to deliver dynamic software demonstrations and influence senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Genuine passion for social impact and mission-driven technology, with the ability to thrive with autonomy, accountability, and a relentless drive to win in a growth-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a full-time, remote position and you must live and reside in the U.S. full-time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; The annual base salary for this position ranges from $85,000–$120,000, with additional On-Target Earnings (OTE) through our commission structure. Actual compensation is based on factors such as the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, experience, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: In addition to our Base and OTE earnings, we offer meaningful equity participation, a mission-driven product with significant market growth, and a clear path to grow as our team scales.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are interested in every qualified candidate eligible to work in the United States; however, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;we cannot accommodate scholastic or employment visas at this time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition, we are not able to consider applicants who reside in the following states: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;551&quot;&gt;Alaska, Delaware, Hawaii, Louisiana, Maine, New Mexico, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Rhode Island, Vermont, Washington, West Virginia, and Wyoming.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/15.0/apple-medium/26a0-fe0f@2x.png&quot; alt=&quot;:warning:&quot; width=&quot;18&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:warning:&quot;&gt; Fraudulent Recruitment Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Submittable will &lt;strong&gt;NEVER&lt;/strong&gt; request bank details, payment, or personal information during the hiring process, nor extend offers without an interview. All legitimate communications come from official &lt;a href=&quot;http://submittable.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;submittable.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. If you receive suspicious outreach, please report it to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:people@submittable.com&quot;&gt;people@submittable.com&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Please do not submit applications, resumes, cover letters, or other candidacy materials to this email address. Emails of this nature will not be reviewed or considered.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
